  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n 2(1)/(4)÷ 1(1)/(2) of left [4(1)/(6)-((17)/(21)+(4)/(3)× 2(1)/(8)÷1(1)/(6) of (3)/(4)-(5)/(7))] \n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of[25/6 – (17/21 + 4/3 × 17/8 ÷ 7/6 of 3/4 – 5/7)]\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of[25/6 – (17/21 + 4/3 × 17/8 ÷ 7/8 – 5/7)\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of[25/6 – (17/21 + 4/3 × 17/8 × 8/7 – 5/7)\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of[25/6 – (17/21 + 68/21 – 5/7)\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of[25/6 – (85 – 15)/21\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of[25/6 – 70/21]\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of[25/6 – 10/3]\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of(25 – 20)/6\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 3/2 of 5/6\n\n⇒ 9/4 ÷ 5/4\n\n⇒ 9/4 × 4/5\n\n⇒ 9/5\n\n⇒ 1(4)/(5)\n\n**∴ The required value is 1(4)/(5)**\n\n1",
